  "id": "sandwich-generation",
  "term": "sandwich generation",
  "definition": "The sandwich generation refers to people, especially women in this study, who are simultaneously managing responsibilities as a mother, a carer for a parent, and a worker. In this context, the term highlights the challenge of balancing caregiving and employment roles at the same time.",
